Z||000000||Alex4mula||11-14-2001||04:03 PM||||I was replacing the axles in my auto Formula with remanufactured ones from CV Unlimited. When I took the passenger side it was longer than the one they provided. I returned them with the core and CV Unlimited guys called me and told me that the axle that I sent is not a stock Fiero axle. They say that replacement fits an Omega or Citation for example. I guess those have the TH125 too. Maybe the tranny in my car is not stock  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Who knows. I’m still not too convinced. Anyway they will send the replacement. Anyone knows if Citation/Omega tranny is same/diff than Fiero? Driver side fitted ok. TIA<P>------------------<BR>    Alex4mula<BR>:) Red-Original Owner & White-1/94 with PM (:||||reg||5
Z||000001||Alex4mula||11-14-2001||04:31 PM||||You can look here the two of them; <A HREF="http://www.ofoto.com/I.jsp?m=39142585203&n=716163658" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ofoto.com/I.jsp?m=39142585203&n=716163658</A> <BR>||||reg||1
